      options: ['The fixed-quantity trigger reacts to actual stock levels as they happen, while the periodic-review approach only checks and reacts at set intervals, which can delay reordering slightly', 'Both approaches always result in exactly the same order timing and quantity', 'Periodic review removes the need for any safety stock whatsoever', 'A fixed reorder trigger can never be combined with any form of periodic physical check'], correct: 0,
