      options: ['A finance co-signature confirms budget availability and adds independent financial oversight for larger commitments', 'Finance input is irrelevant to procurement decisions of any size', 'Co-signing requirements apply only to purchases funded entirely by external donors', 'A single signature is always sufficient oversight regardless of value'], correct: 0,
